* micro-ecc (uECC) — BSD 2-Clause License
  Location : components/routeloom/third_party/micro-ecc/ (LICENSE.txt)
  Copyright: (c) 2014, Kenneth MacKay
  Upstream : https://github.com/kmackay/micro-ecc
  Notes    : Vendored source snapshot inside the portable component so
